  "title": "A new flat",
  "text": "Hi Ola,\n\nHow are you? I'm in my new flat now! It is in Gdańsk, near the sea. The flat is small, but it is very nice. There is a living room, a bedroom, a kitchen and a bathroom. My bedroom has got a big window and I can see the park.\n\nMy neighbours are friendly. Next door there is an old man with a funny dog. I go to work by bus. It takes twenty minutes.\n\nCan you visit me in June? We can go to the beach together.\n\nLove,\nKasia",
